    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eewuo ororei lo Laitoriani enetii Yeremia enkata e are, eton eikenoro to lgoriet le rripore ejo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nji ejo Olaitoriani laa ninye oitobira enkop, Olaitoriani oipirua ninye neitobiru ninye, Olaitoriani enkarna enye: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpotoki nanu naa kaairuk iyie; naa kaaliki iyie ntokitin sapuki naaisudoro neitu iyie iyiolou. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu nji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai e Israel, tialo nkajijik ena anasa o nkajijik oo laiguanak le Yuda apa naatuuroyioki aasulaki enkop pee eitobirieki isempewueti ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o te nkaraki o lalem loo lmang'ati. Kepuonu Ilkaldayo aagilunore intae neiput ninche mpopoki oo ltung'ana laar nanu te ngoro ai o te ngoro ai napi, amu aisudoyie nanu enkomom ai pee maing'or ena anasa tenkaraki entorroni enye pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ura, kayau nanu atua ninye embiotisho e nkishiunoto, naa kaishiunye nanu ninche naboloki ninche enkiputakinoto e dupoto o eseriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kashuku nanu lelo ootaarayioki le Yuda o loo taarayioki le Israel, naitoki ashetu ninche metotiwuo anaa enatiu apake te dukuya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kaitisiny nanu ninche te ntorroni pooki oo ng'ok enye o engolong'akinoto naatogolong'akitia nanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa keaku ena anasa te nanu enkarna e ng'ida, enkisisa o enkitoo te dukuya iloreren pooki le nkop ooning nena kenya pooki sidain naitaas nanu ninche; keureshoyu ninche neikirikira tenkaraki inapooki sidai o karsisisho pooki naisho nanu ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
