          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nji ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani: Ore taata ene wueji naa olmuaate, metii oltung'ani aashu eng'ues, o tiatua nkanas enyena pooki keitoki aaigil aajing imanyishoritin oo lairritak loo ntare eing'or nkerrai enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore tiatua nkanas eina kop oo ldoinyo, tiatua nkanas e Shefala, o tiatua nkanas e Negeb tiatua enkop e Benchamen, nene wuejitin neemanita Yerusalem, o tiatua nkanas e Yuda, keitoki nkerrai aaim abori nkaik eilo oiken ninche; Olaitoriani ojo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
